-- Version 35 → 36 (issue #170, decision 2026-11-25 "Share · location links"): a plan made from a shared maps link
-- keeps the link (opened in the maps app, never fetched) and, when the link carried them, the coordinates, so the
-- meetup logged when the plan closes gets them. NULL = none, as before; nothing to backfill.
ALTER TABLE plan ADD COLUMN map_link TEXT;
ALTER TABLE plan ADD COLUMN latitude REAL;
ALTER TABLE plan ADD COLUMN longitude REAL;
